# Git Cheat Cube

This cube should help git users like me finding the right git commands. Easy to print, cut and assemble!

Based on github online ressource : https://training.github.com/downloads/fr/github-git-cheat-sheet/
Original model from @Thomas-Do for arch linux, derived by @machinekoder for git

Completed French version : @Jaxom99

